# Routes 34 to 37 (and their gate houses): HeartGold gives the roads between Goldenrod and Ecruteak one theme in two
# arrangements (SEQ_GS_R_4_34, SEQ_GS_R_5_34), and this game one song for both: a striding clarinet in G major over a
# pulsing bass and an off-beat guitar. Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J5, part b).
